，破笮融、薛禮。轉下湖孰、江乘，進入曲阿。劉繇奔走，而策之眾已數萬矣。因謂瑜曰：「吾以此眾取吳會平山越已足。卿還鎮丹楊。」瑜還。頃之，袁術遣從弟胤代尚為太守，而瑜與尚俱還壽春。術欲以瑜為將，瑜觀術終無所成，故求為居巢長，欲假塗東歸，術聽之。遂自居巢還吳。是歲，建安三年也。","source_term":"景子忠"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu054-zhouyu-1","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"sk1_f2q_pzy_AA","label":"周暉〔忠子、洛陽令〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"暉","mention_ids":["c-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054:p001:m0002"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-houhanshu","book_id":"b-houhanshu-045","chapter_id":"c-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054","source_id":"s-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054","paragraph_id":"c-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054:p001","mention_id":"c-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054:p001:m0002","quote":"暉"}],"identity_note":"依本篇具名、稱謂及其所在原句辨認；引書原字存於各自來源。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"sk1_f2q_pzy_A","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-houhanshu","book_id":"b-houhanshu-045","chapter_id":"c-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054","source_id":"s-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054","paragraph_id":"c-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054:p001","quote":"忠子暉，前為洛陽令，去官歸。","source_term":"忠子暉"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu054-zhouhui-father-zhong","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054","work_id":"w-houhanshu","book_id":"b-houhanshu-045","chapter_id":"c-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054:p001:m0000"],"paragraph_ids":["c-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054:p001:m0000","mention_ids":["c-houhanshu-045-zhouzhong-zhouhui-wu054:p001:m0000"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_men